---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Glen Hutajulu, Product Designer"
  description="Product designer for AI-powered, data-heavy products, across telco, fintech and travel. Based in Jakarta, working remotely (GMT+7)."
  home
>
<section class="h2" aria-label="Introduction">
<div class="h2-stick">
<span class="dot" aria-hidden="true" style="left: 12%; top: 22%; background: #1E3A5F"></span>
<span class="dot" aria-hidden="true" style="left: 34%; top: 15%; background: #B8892B"></span>
<span class="dot" aria-hidden="true" style="left: 63%; top: 24%; background: #4A5D6E"></span>
<span class="dot" aria-hidden="true" style="left: 86%; top: 17%; background: #6E2A2A"></span>
<span class="dot" aria-hidden="true" style="left: 24%; top: 73%; background: #2F5D46"></span>
<span class="dot" aria-hidden="true" style="left: 74%; top: 69%; background: #6B7A2E"></span>
<div class="h2-mid">
<h1 class="wm px-font intro" aria-label="Glen Hutajulu"><span aria-hidden="true"><span class="w w1"><span class="c" style="--i: 0">g</span><span class="c" style="--i: 1">l</span><span class="c" style="--i: 2">e</span><span class="c" style="--i: 3">n</span></span> <span class="w w2"><span class="c" style="--i: 4">h</span><span class="c" style="--i: 5">u</span><span class="c" style="--i: 6">t</span><span class="c" style="--i: 7">a</span><span class="c" style="--i: 8">j</span><span class="c" style="--i: 9">u</span><span class="c" style="--i: 10">l</span><span class="c" style="--i: 11">u</span></span></span></h1>
<p class="h2-sub mono">Product designer · AI-powered, data-heavy products</p>
</div>
<div class="h2-copy">
<p class="hero-lede">I turn complex enterprise data into tools people can act on. Telco, fintech and travel, 3+ years.</p>
<p class="mono" style="color: #4A4E53">Scroll for selected work ↓</p>
</div>
<div class="h2-side">
<div class="chips mono"><span>AI/LLM UX</span><span>Dashboards</span><span>Fintech</span><span>Telco</span><span>Research</span></div>
<p class="mono">Jakarta, GMT+7 · Open to remote roles</p>
</div>
<div class="h2-dark" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="stk" id="work" aria-label="Selected work">
<div class="stk-stick">
<div class="stk-head mono"><span><span class="sq" style="color: var(--acc)"></span>Selected work</span><span class="stk-n">&#123;01—04&#125;</span></div>

<article class="wk">
<a class="wk-card" href="/work/energy-analytics" aria-label="Arsenal case study"><span class="wk-fig"><img src="/work/arsenal/cover.webp" width="2560" height="1600" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" alt="Voltwise dashboard with KPI cards and a site map"><span class="wk-go" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
<div class="wk-story">
<p class="mono">&#123;01&#125; AI analytics, telco, 2025–2026</p>
<h3 class="px-font">arsenal</h3>
<dl class="mono">
<div><dt>Problem</dt><dd>HQ and 12 regional teams dug through spreadsheets to understand power use and bills across around 60,000 tower sites.</dd></div>
<div><dt>My role</dt><dd>Sole designer, concept to pre-launch, with engineers, data scientists, QA and a PM.</dd></div>
<div><dt>Outcome</dt><dd>Pre-launch. The HQ team confirmed the design works.</dd></div>
</dl>
<a class="wk-link mono" href="/work/energy-analytics">Read the case study ↗</a>
</div>
</article>

<article class="wk">
<a class="wk-card" href="/work/fifgo" aria-label="FIFGO case study"><span class="wk-fig"><img src="/work/fifgo/cover.webp" width="2400" height="1600" decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="FIFGO app on a phone beside the FIFGROUP website on a laptop"><span class="wk-go" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
<div class="wk-story">
<p class="mono">&#123;02&#125; Consumer finance, 2023–2024</p>
<h3 class="px-font">fifgo</h3>
<dl class="mono">
<div><dt>Problem</dt><dd>The app and website could not generate quality leads, and applying for a loan was too long and complex.</dd></div>
<div><dt>My role</dt><dd>UI/UX designer at Aleph, in a project team.</dd></div>
<div><dt>Outcome</dt><dd>In UAT, users finished the loan flow in under 7 minutes with zero drop-off.</dd></div>
</dl>
<a class="wk-link mono" href="/work/fifgo">Read the case study ↗</a>
</div>
</article>

<article class="wk">
<a class="wk-card" href="/work/orbit" aria-label="Telkomsel Orbit case study"><span class="wk-fig"><img src="/work/orbit/tile.webp" width="1600" height="1200" decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Telkomsel Orbit website on a laptop beside two phones"><span class="wk-go" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
<div class="wk-story">
<p class="mono">&#123;03&#125; Telco, 2024</p>
<h3 class="px-font">orbit</h3>
<dl class="mono">
<div><dt>Problem</dt><dd>A fixed wireless internet service needed a clearer site and simpler login, purchase and modem pairing.</dd></div>
<div><dt>My role</dt><dd>UI/UX designer at Aleph, in a project team.</dd></div>
<div><dt>Outcome</dt><dd>Partially released between June and December 2024.</dd></div>
</dl>
<a class="wk-link mono" href="/work/orbit">Read the case study ↗</a>
</div>
</article>

<article class="wk">
<a class="wk-card" href="/work/byu" aria-label="byU case study"><span class="wk-fig"><img src="/work/byu/tile.webp" width="1600" height="1200" decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Three phones showing the byU app home, help centre and topic screens"><span class="wk-go" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
<div class="wk-story">
<p class="mono">&#123;04&#125; Telco research, 2022–2023</p>
<h3 class="px-font">byU</h3>
<dl class="mono">
<div><dt>Problem</dt><dd>Customers reporting a weak signal answered too many questions before getting help.</dd></div>
<div><dt>My role</dt><dd>UX researcher and designer, intern.</dd></div>
<div><dt>Outcome</dt><dd>Four recommendations, including cutting the bot flow from 10 questions to 7.</dd></div>
</dl>
<a class="wk-link mono" href="/work/byu">Read the case study ↗</a>
</div>
</article>
</div>
</section>

<section class="more" aria-label="More work">
<h2 class="px-font rv">more work</h2>
<div>
<a class="row rv" href="https://groupbintang.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Bintang Manunggal Pratama</strong><span class="mono">Corporate website, 2024 ↗</span></a>
<a class="row rv" href="https://shilohcore.framer.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>ShilohCore</strong><span class="mono">Company website, 2025 ↗</span></a>
<p class="rv">Need a website rather than a product designer? <a href="/services">See how I work with clients</a>.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="focus" aria-label="What I focus on">
<p class="mono rv"><span class="sq"></span>What I focus on</p>
<h2 class="px-font rv">from complex data to websites that convert.</h2>
<div class="focus-grid">
<div class="rv"><h3 class="px-font">ai &amp; llm products</h3><p>How people ask an AI for answers and check what it tells them. I lead design on an LLM-powered analytics dashboard for a telco network team.</p></div>
<div class="rv" style="--d: .1s"><h3 class="px-font">data-heavy dashboards</h3><p>Spreadsheets, KPIs and maps turned into screens a team can scan, compare and act on.</p></div>
<div class="rv" style="--d: .2s"><h3 class="px-font">websites that convert</h3><p>Beautiful, easy to use and made to turn visitors into enquiries. Designed and built end to end for companies worldwide.</p><a class="focus-link mono" href="/services">See services ↗</a></div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="how" aria-label="How I work">
<h2 class="px-font rv">how i work</h2>
<div class="how-grid">
<article class="rv"><p class="mono" style="color: #9DA2A8">Step 01</p><h3 class="px-font">understand</h3><p>Stakeholder interviews, user interviews and journey mapping, turned into user stories and information architecture.</p><img src="/img/step-understand.webp" width="1440" height="960" decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Illustration of a user speaking beside a journey map, interview notes and a sticky note"></article>
<article class="rv" style="--d: .12s"><p class="mono" style="color: #9DA2A8">Step 02</p><h3 class="px-font">design</h3><p>Flows, high-fidelity UI and prototypes, with design rationale presented directly to stakeholders.</p><img src="/img/step-design.webp" width="1440" height="960" decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Illustration of one screen going from wireframe to grey layout to final UI"></article>
<article class="rv" style="--d: .24s"><p class="mono" style="color: #9DA2A8">Step 03</p><h3 class="px-font">validate</h3><p>Usability testing, then handoff to engineers, data scientists and QA.</p><img src="/img/step-validate.webp" width="1440" height="960" decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Illustration of a phone being tapped between a checklist and a code panel"></article>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
